Spec: Deliver project
Purpose:
  Coordinate a project-manager workflow whose changes stay inside explicit specifications.
Platform: Node.js 22 or newer
Structure:
  /plugins: Deliver plugin code and assets.
  /tests: Tests for Deliver support code.
Owns:
  The project-level workflow contract and its boundaries.
Must:
  Read the relevant spec chain before changing implementation files.
  Keep implementation writes inside the editable scope declared by the relevant specs.
Must not:
  Treat prose or unprefixed names in Owns as filesystem paths.
  Widen an authorization snapshot by editing a .sdd file during inspection.
